    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/98ed9b4a-b1be-48b9-a852-947e04b2c295-50.jpg\" /><br />Gravitational force on each mass &#39;M&#39;<br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />This force will provide required centripetal force<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>